es\nHatch Once Button \n– Hatches the selected egg once (checks if you have enough coins)\nAuto Hatch Toggle \n– Automatically hatches the selected egg whenever you have enough coins\nStatus display \n– Shows selected egg, hatching status, or insufficient coins warning\n====================================================\nKeybinds Tab\nCollect & Home (Default: G)\nHome (Default: F)\nSplit (Default: H)\nToggle Auto Farm (Default: J)\nSell All (Default: K)\n\nWhen Auto Farm is active, other keybinds are ignored to prevent interference.\n====================================================","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf","username":"legazyhax19","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/381c0314f57445053752947b81f07ba66e6c660fa1c03f9673be0433e102e01f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf-1775219207273.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/381c0314f57445053752947b81f07ba66e6c660fa1c03f9673be0433e102e01f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf-1775219207273.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:24:18.244Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69cf5324c9beff7e3c21935e","editBy":{"_id":"69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf","username":"legazyhax19","status":"offline","id":"69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-04-03T05:41:56.232Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69cf814322c8e2af2b254a77","commentBy":{"_id":"69c2576b922defaf32dd0bbf","username":"legazyhax19","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/381c0314f57445053752947b81f07ba66e6c660fa1c03f9673b